    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFIGURE YOUR BLAMCON LIGHT GUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This utility will help you configure your Blamcon Light gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Up Your Blamcon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Default Key Bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Your Light Gun's Functions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blamcon ARC (Advanced Remote Console) allows you to customize all functions of your Blamcon Light Gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVANCED FUNCTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set functions like: Offscreen Reload, Sensor Layout, Emulation Mode, and even select between different cursor smoothing algorithms to play the way that's best for you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFIGURE YOUR BLAMCON LIGHT GUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This utility will help you configure your Blamcon Light gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Up Your Blamcon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Default Key Bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Your Light Gun's Functions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blamcon ARC (Advanced Remote Console) allows you to customize all functions of your Blamcon Light Gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVANCED FUNCTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set functions like: Offscreen Reload, Sensor Layout, Emulation Mode, and even select between different cursor smoothing algorithms to play the way that's best for you.</p>",
